title: "PALM: Pathology-Aware Lightweight Mustard-disease framework"
abstract: >
  Imbalance-robust, field-deployable deep learning for mustard (Brassica juncea)
  leaf disease classification, with a Leaf-Attention-Fidelity metric for
  validating that predictions are grounded in plant tissue rather than
  background clutter.
